WEBVTT

00:01.970 --> 00:04.530
Ready, Elis? Be sure to hold on tight!

00:04.520 --> 00:05.400
O-Okay!

02:39.220 --> 02:40.760
T-That's impossible!

02:40.760 --> 02:43.300
Who the hell are you?!

02:43.760 --> 02:48.550
Just a Wizard who doesn't appreciate Anzelotte's methods, that's all.

02:49.320 --> 02:52.450
Come, allow me to entertain you for a little longer.

02:53.590 --> 02:55.560
An unknown Wizard.

02:55.560 --> 02:56.850
Kirihito?

02:56.850 --> 03:03.000
Yes, and as for the location of the deserter Hiiragi Renji and Syaimaar, the search is underway.

03:03.000 --> 03:06.740
Once found they will be captured, or eliminated.

03:07.520 --> 03:12.210
You should have known things would turn out like this, Hiiragi-san.

03:12.800 --> 03:18.070
Make haste, we don't know when Syaimaar will awaken, we cannot afford any delays.

03:18.070 --> 03:18.730
Yes, sir!

03:20.020 --> 03:23.180
What are you doing, Hiiragi?

03:33.260 --> 03:34.750
Hiiragi-senpai.

03:34.750 --> 03:36.280
Stop worrying.

03:36.280 --> 03:39.990
They probably thought we escaped using a Broom.

03:41.550 --> 03:46.950
If we return now, won't we just be causing a lot of trouble for everyone?

03:48.420 --> 03:51.860
There is no place left for me...

03:51.860 --> 03:52.830
Idiot.

03:53.650 --> 04:00.960
Troubling otheres? It's more troubling to see someone sad and suffering yet keeping it to themself.

04:01.470 --> 04:03.260
At least, that's how I feel.

04:04.290 --> 04:05.320
Listen.

04:05.320 --> 04:08.800
I'm not staying with you because I have to.

04:08.800 --> 04:10.010
It's because I am your friend.

04:10.010 --> 04:11.250
So I want to help.

04:11.250 --> 04:13.240
Is it weird for me to think that way?

04:15.290 --> 04:20.320
Well, that's that. So don't go around saying you don't have a place here anymore.

04:20.780 --> 04:24.000
Even if I am Syaimaar?

04:24.000 --> 04:26.000
I'm used to being with scary girls.

04:26.780 --> 04:33.360
Greater Devils. androids, "Protectors of the world", and shrines maidens, especially Kureha!

04:33.360 --> 04:36.460
They're far too violent and talk too much.

04:37.840 --> 04:42.760
I envy Kureha-san, she always has you by her side.

04:44.270 --> 04:45.930
D-Don't joke like that!

04:46.560 --> 04:48.110
It's not like I'm with her because I want to.

04:48.110 --> 04:50.320
It's something she does on her own!

05:02.440 --> 05:05.030
Greater Devil Bell, where are you headed?

05:05.430 --> 05:09.500
I am just going to go and confirm the truth behind my speculations.

05:09.500 --> 05:10.720
Speculation?

05:10.720 --> 05:14.710
That's right. I was happy that Anzelotte was surprised by it.

05:14.710 --> 05:19.500
But that I, Bell Zephyr, had the Jewel taken from my hand, cannot be overlooked.

05:20.110 --> 05:25.670
There is only one person I can think of who could be pulling the strings, orchestrating the events surrounding the Jewel.

05:26.390 --> 05:28.220
So I am going to see if it's true.

05:29.020 --> 05:32.010
Have a safe trip, Bell. Good luck.

05:32.010 --> 05:33.430
Oh, you're coming with me.

05:33.430 --> 05:37.100
My oh my, what a slave driver you are.

05:37.910 --> 05:42.560
But, I am rather curious about this as well.

05:42.560 --> 05:43.510
Right?

05:59.270 --> 06:01.760
This place sure brings back a lot of old memories...

06:17.760 --> 06:19.820
Ah, that's the place.

06:24.120 --> 06:26.280
Nothing's changed.

06:27.780 --> 06:30.000
Hiiragi-senpai, come with me.

06:33.230 --> 06:34.160
Look at this.

06:34.630 --> 06:39.470
When I left this place, everyone carved their name here on this tree.

06:39.470 --> 06:43.480
It was so that we wouldn't forget that we were all here.

06:45.200 --> 06:46.160
Excuse me.

06:48.150 --> 06:49.460
Sensei!

06:52.200 --> 06:53.420
Elis-chan!

06:55.060 --> 06:56.550
It has been a while.

06:56.550 --> 06:57.850
Yes, it has.

06:57.850 --> 06:59.260
Have you been healthy?

06:59.260 --> 07:00.290
Yes!

07:00.770 --> 07:02.250
And who might this person be?

07:02.250 --> 07:05.190
This is my classmate, Hiiragi-senpai.

07:05.190 --> 07:07.110
He's a senpai, yet he's your classmate?

07:07.880 --> 07:10.240
Yes, well, a lot happened.

07:12.030 --> 07:13.000
Here you go.

07:13.000 --> 07:14.660
Thank you.

07:15.460 --> 07:20.370
Umm, about the contact information of Elis' Oji-sama...

07:21.430 --> 07:25.460
Actually, we ourselves don't know his address.

07:25.460 --> 07:26.840
You don't know?

07:26.840 --> 07:27.820
No.

07:27.820 --> 07:32.750
He never contacted us himself, but instead always used a middle man.

07:33.280 --> 07:35.430
Is that... so...?

07:35.430 --> 07:40.010
If I'm not mistaken, tomorrow is your birthday, right?

07:40.510 --> 07:42.640
You won't be able to meet him if you're not in Tokyo, am I correct?

07:43.260 --> 07:44.310
Yes...

07:44.310 --> 07:50.280
Well, some things came up, so we thought that maybe we would be able to meet him here.

07:51.950 --> 07:53.580
I'm not going to ask anymore.

07:53.580 --> 07:56.430
Both of you, why don't you stay here for the night?

07:56.430 --> 07:58.000
Thank you.

07:58.000 --> 07:59.000
I'm sorry.

07:59.490 --> 08:00.340
Hey!

08:00.340 --> 08:01.330
Don't push me!

08:04.530 --> 08:05.740
Everyone!

08:05.740 --> 08:08.250
Kids, you can come in!

08:09.460 --> 08:10.320
I'm back!

08:10.320 --> 08:11.690
Sis, welcome back!

08:11.690 --> 08:12.910
Play with us, will you?

08:12.910 --> 08:13.560
Okay!

08:13.560 --> 08:15.310
Make some madelines!

08:15.310 --> 08:16.170
Sure.

08:16.170 --> 08:17.640
Yay!

08:16.520 --> 08:18.970
Sensei, may I use the kitchen?

08:19.230 --> 08:22.930
Yes, of course! And do make some for me too, okay?

08:22.930 --> 08:23.940
Sure!

08:23.940 --> 08:25.570
I'll help!

08:25.570 --> 08:26.780
Me too!

08:26.780 --> 08:28.540
Let's all do it together!

08:28.540 --> 08:29.860
Yay!

08:32.110 --> 08:33.680
I'm gonna eat five.

08:33.680 --> 08:35.440
Then I'll eat six.

08:36.630 --> 08:38.490
Anything I can do to help?

08:38.490 --> 08:41.750
No, Hiiragi-senpai, just wait right there for bit.

08:42.130 --> 08:43.960
They'll be done shortly.

08:43.960 --> 08:45.000
Okay.

08:45.000 --> 08:47.170
You look like a newlywed!

08:48.000 --> 08:49.630
You're blushing!

08:49.630 --> 08:51.440
Bath, meals, and sleep!

08:51.440 --> 08:52.990
No we're not.

08:52.990 --> 08:55.760
He's actually with a girl named Kureha-san!

08:55.760 --> 08:56.890
Don't say scary stuff!

08:56.290 --> 09:03.810
Newlyweds! Newlyweds!

09:09.470 --> 09:11.980
This picture brings back memories...

09:12.520 --> 09:16.750
This is the picture we all took when we were having a picnic at Kaihin Park.

09:16.750 --> 09:18.260
I'm in the picture as well!

09:18.260 --> 09:21.250
You fell into the sea that day, right?

09:21.250 --> 09:23.250
You don't need to bring that up...

09:24.540 --> 09:28.230
Everyone, it's time for your afternoon nap, come.

09:28.230 --> 09:30.000
Okay!

09:30.000 --> 09:31.380
See you later.

09:32.800 --> 09:34.600
Be sure to brush your teeth.

09:34.600 --> 09:36.350
Yes.

09:36.350 --> 09:38.010
Now then, take your time.

09:40.120 --> 09:41.910
They are all good kids.

09:41.910 --> 09:47.480
Yes, they realized I never knew my parents' faces.

09:47.480 --> 09:50.270
But I never once felt lonely.

09:51.190 --> 09:59.600
Because sensei, Miki-chan, Maya-chan, and Tetsu-kun... everyone was there for me.

10:08.470 --> 10:10.000
Looks like you've cheered up a bit.

10:11.100 --> 10:14.130
A happy face really does fit you.

10:21.390 --> 10:23.380
This one...

10:23.380 --> 10:26.560
This is the picture we took right before I left this place.

10:29.850 --> 10:32.910
Sensei, Onee-chan ain't going back for a while, right?

10:32.910 --> 10:35.840
Yes, she said she'll be staying here tonight.

10:35.840 --> 10:36.780
Yay!

10:38.580 --> 10:42.940
I... cried a bit that day and then...

10:42.940 --> 10:43.740
Umm...

11:22.710 --> 11:26.240
Eh? Which is the picture with you in it again?

11:26.770 --> 11:30.910
What? Look, it's here...

11:38.520 --> 11:41.970
Huh? I'm... in here...

11:49.590 --> 11:52.000
I was really... here...

11:52.000 --> 11:55.770
I was right here, next to Miki-chan...

11:55.770 --> 11:57.020
I was there...

12:02.120 --> 12:08.810
I was definitely... here... here... I was there!

12:09.410 --> 12:10.320
No!

12:10.320 --> 12:11.600
Hey, Elis!

12:12.270 --> 12:13.250
Elis!

12:49.900 --> 12:51.000
Elis...

12:51.470 --> 12:53.070
Hiiragi-senpai...

12:53.540 --> 12:56.220
I... I...

12:56.220 --> 12:58.840
I was really here...

12:59.280 --> 13:00.340
I was!

13:06.040 --> 13:06.980
Umm...

13:12.550 --> 13:13.910
Sensei!

13:15.020 --> 13:16.690
Umm, I...

13:17.200 --> 13:20.110
Excuse me, but... who might you be?

13:21.490 --> 13:24.940
This place is off limits to outsiders.

13:25.880 --> 13:27.070
Sensei...

13:27.720 --> 13:28.590
Who're they?

13:28.590 --> 13:29.990
Dunno.

13:29.990 --> 13:33.290
Sensei, what happened?!

13:33.290 --> 13:34.620
It's me-

13:39.120 --> 13:41.630
Shiho Elis.

13:42.060 --> 13:44.620
Can you please stop with the bad jokes?

13:45.250 --> 13:50.650
Elis-chan is... that girl died in an accident when she was five years old.

13:52.450 --> 13:53.740
That's...

13:54.660 --> 13:56.930
But, I-

13:56.930 --> 13:59.000
If there is nothing else you need, please leave at once.

14:03.770 --> 14:05.000
Elis!

14:07.480 --> 14:10.520
Shiho Elis' past has disappeared.

14:10.520 --> 14:18.350
Yes, she was created from nothingness to be the vessel for Syaimaar's reincarnation.

14:18.350 --> 14:23.000
Her memories and past were artificial from the beginning.

14:23.400 --> 14:25.380
A life of lies.

14:26.320 --> 14:33.260
Most likely, Shiho Elis was created a few days before she made contact with Hiiragi Renji and the others.

14:33.260 --> 14:41.550
The only thing that supports her right now, are the memories of the few days she was with Hiiragi Renji and the others.

14:41.550 --> 14:43.350
And if that too disappears...

14:43.350 --> 14:48.780
All the chains that bind Syaimaar within Elis will be broken.

14:48.780 --> 14:50.410
It's like that, am I correct?

14:50.410 --> 14:52.990
And the only who can do this is...

14:53.840 --> 14:55.370
Let us hurry, Leon.

14:55.370 --> 14:59.320
We must drag him out of the shadows and into the stage.

15:03.010 --> 15:05.640
Oji-sama's letter hasn't changed.

15:06.480 --> 15:11.440
But, I was always the one who baked madelines...

15:11.440 --> 15:16.010
When they ate them, they smiled even if they'd been fighting. And they would make up with each other.

15:16.010 --> 15:19.730
Sitting next to them with Miki-chan...

15:20.230 --> 15:22.730
Huh? Who was Miki-chan again...?

15:23.230 --> 15:25.210
Somehow, I can't remember!

15:26.160 --> 15:29.720
Hiiragi-senpai, say something!

15:29.720 --> 15:32.320
Or have, you too... about me...

15:33.150 --> 15:36.010
There's no way I could forget about you!

15:36.010 --> 15:37.660
We've been together all this time-

15:40.660 --> 15:41.800
A Lunar Casket?

15:41.800 --> 15:44.620
No, there's no Red Moon anywhere.

15:45.240 --> 15:46.230
Akari-chan?

15:47.120 --> 15:50.490
I always thought you'd come back to this town.

15:51.090 --> 15:55.720
Shiho Elis, I am to capture you, or eliminate you.

15:56.280 --> 15:58.180
Hey, what are you saying, Akari?!

15:58.180 --> 16:02.070
Hiiragi Renji, you should understand.

16:02.070 --> 16:07.490
The reincarnation vessel Elis, her past and memories are artificial.

16:07.490 --> 16:10.070
And its breakdown cannot be stopped.	

16:12.650 --> 16:17.550
And the only thing waiting after its breakdown, is Syaimaar's resurrection.

16:17.550 --> 16:21.940
Elis, one day you will lose yourself.

16:22.630 --> 16:24.210
Gunner's Broom.

16:30.010 --> 16:31.460
Is this the only way we can settle this?

16:35.250 --> 16:36.180
Hiiragi-senpai?!

16:36.180 --> 16:40.810
Do you understand what you are doing, Hiiragi Renji?

16:40.810 --> 16:42.940
I should be asking you that!

16:42.940 --> 16:44.770
Can you shoot Elis down?!

16:44.770 --> 16:47.290
If there's no other way.

16:47.830 --> 16:51.590
And that, is probably only a matter of time.

16:54.180 --> 16:57.080
You're serious about it, huh, Akari?

16:58.770 --> 17:00.010
Hiiragi-senpai!

17:00.010 --> 17:01.200
Akari-chan!

17:02.870 --> 17:04.040
Get back, Elis!

17:18.970 --> 17:21.510
If I can't take the fight to close range, I can't win!

17:29.860 --> 17:32.320
Hiiragi-senpai! Akari-chan!

17:36.360 --> 17:37.910
Illusion Dance.

17:40.830 --> 17:42.040
She jumped?!

17:42.040 --> 17:46.830
It's only an illusion that I am not adept at close range fighting.

18:04.170 --> 18:07.640
Shit, she's the same even in close range?!

18:07.640 --> 18:12.610
Hiiragi Renji, lower your weapon and hand over Shiho Elis.

18:12.610 --> 18:13.870
I refuse!

18:13.870 --> 18:18.950
Then fight me with everything you have, I am seeing too much confusion in your steps.

18:19.550 --> 18:22.000
In that state, you cannot defeat me.

18:23.500 --> 18:25.790
Hiiragi... senpai...

18:27.390 --> 18:29.540
Then I'll fight you seriously.

18:32.520 --> 18:35.680
Shoot me and my sword.

18:36.270 --> 18:40.680
We'll see who will win, your Gunners Broom or my Sword.

18:43.710 --> 18:45.750
It's a showdown, Akari.

19:34.420 --> 19:36.020
You still want to fight?

19:37.990 --> 19:42.230
Having lost my weapon, there's no way I can win a fight that's three against one.

19:42.230 --> 19:43.490
Three against one?

19:45.160 --> 19:46.580
Kirihito-kun...

19:46.580 --> 19:48.090
You were all right.

19:48.090 --> 19:52.730
Yes, I came here to protect you...

19:52.730 --> 19:56.660
But it looks like Hiiragi Renji got the limelight.

19:59.650 --> 20:02.650
Himuro Akari to Longinus Leader.

20:03.290 --> 20:09.680
At 16:00 hours, weapon destroyed in the fight against Hiiragi Renji and Syaimaar.

20:09.680 --> 20:12.980
The target is on the run, and I have lost sight of them.

20:12.980 --> 20:14.750
I will now return.

20:15.230 --> 20:16.150
End of report.

20:18.820 --> 20:22.330
Say, Akari, why don't you come with us?

20:22.920 --> 20:26.660
You understand that Elis is innocent too, right?

20:26.660 --> 20:30.090
Mikoto is... waiting for me.

20:32.790 --> 20:36.500
Akari-chan... has someone she wants to protect.

20:37.300 --> 20:41.000
Yet, I have nothing, not even a past.

20:42.180 --> 20:43.650
Let's go back to the school.

20:45.000 --> 20:52.600
At the very least, we were together from the day you transferred to the school until now.

20:54.000 --> 20:59.650
With Akari and Kureha, the memories of the days we all spent together are real.

21:00.200 --> 21:01.190
Isn't that right?

21:03.270 --> 21:04.230
Yes.

21:05.750 --> 21:09.530
Akari-san has... failed in her attempt to secure Syaimaar.

21:09.530 --> 21:13.800
Yes, Hiiragi Renji is currently on the run, taking Syaimaar with him.

21:13.800 --> 21:15.670
That is all we know at this time.

21:15.670 --> 21:16.790
Is that so?

21:18.650 --> 21:21.000
You are too soft, Akari-san.

21:27.200 --> 21:28.550
Who dares-?!

21:30.510 --> 21:31.680
A Devil?!

21:32.240 --> 21:34.640
How did you get this far without being detected?!

21:35.020 --> 21:36.780
Vertical Shot.

21:45.680 --> 21:49.490
Now what have we here, a very unusual customer indeed.

21:49.890 --> 21:52.330
The secret Duchess, Leon Guntar.

21:53.260 --> 21:54.330
And...

21:55.480 --> 21:58.360
Don't make such a scary face, will you?

21:58.360 --> 22:01.290
I've come in peace to speak with you.

22:01.290 --> 22:06.300
That was really peaceful of you, Bell Zephyr.

22:28.820 --> 22:30.240
The legendary tree.

22:45.230 --> 22:46.010
Who's there?

22:58.350 --> 23:01.060
Elis-chan... Hiiragi...

23:02.810 --> 23:04.940
Kureha... san...

23:04.940 --> 23:07.020
Don't tell me, even you too...

23:07.630 --> 23:08.280
Kureha!

23:14.270 --> 23:16.490
KUREHA!!!

24:50.980 --> 24:53.000
The parting of friends.

24:53.000 --> 24:55.430
The fleeting memories.

24:56.000 --> 24:59.600
And Elis is, slowly breaking down.

25:00.850 --> 25:04.690
Hiiragi Renji, are you still going to protect Elis?

25:05.500 --> 25:08.660
Next, on Night Wizard THE ANIMATION:

25:09.270 --> 25:10.490
"Good Bye."

25:11.480 --> 25:14.240
You're kidding me, right? Kureha.
